OL,3,GNEWSAHigh street businesses say ferry
OL,4,Aclosure hit trade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ferry stopped after council funding
OL,7,Fended, but Gravesham MP Dr Lauren
OL,8,FSullivan will hold a summit on 16
OL,9,FOctober, bringing together councils,
OL,10,Fbusinesses and ferry companies to
OL,11,Fexplore whether it can be restored.
